'''Basilio''' (from Greek ''[[W:Basilisk|basilískos]]''; {{Literally|little king|}}) is a [[Communes of Balisca|barrio]] located on the [[Sauzalito]] peninsula of the [[Trinacria]] borough, within the [[Castejón Metropolis]]. It is the third polycentric [[W:Central business district|central business district]] to emerge in the metropolis (after [[Mercadero]] and [[Sant Dídac]] and followed by [[Gistaín]]).  

Since the adoption of the [[Casajuan Plan]], there has been a boom in housing development, typically with the conversion of former office space into [[W:Mixed-use development|mixed-use developments]].

